    <fr:title text="Height at n ≤ 9">Height at n ≤ 9</fr:title>
    <fr:taxon>theorem</fr:taxon>
    <fr:meta name="area">height</fr:meta>
    <fr:meta name="status">conditional</fr:meta>
  </fr:frontmatter>
  <fr:mainmatter>
    <html:p><fr:link href="/ffi/ffi-0009/" title="The height conjecture" uri="https://www.brendan.phd/ffi/ffi-0009/" display-uri="ffi-0009" type="local">The height conjecture</fr:link> holds for every <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[n \le  9]]></fr:tex> and
every prime power <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[q]]></fr:tex>. Unconditionally for <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[n \le  7]]></fr:tex>; for <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[n = 8, 9]]></fr:tex>
conditional on published modality rows and machine certificates.</html:p>
    <html:p>The ladder is climbed rung by rung, because <fr:link href="/ffi/ffi-0010/" title="(*): the characteristic-p subvariety inference" uri="https://www.brendan.phd/ffi/ffi-0010/" display-uri="ffi-0010" type="local">(*)</fr:link> is
unavailable and each <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[n]]></fr:tex> has to be discharged by its own count. The
rungs are <fr:link href="/ffi/ffi-0019/" title="Height at n ≤ 5" uri="https://www.brendan.phd/ffi/ffi-0019/" display-uri="ffi-0019" type="local">height at <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[n \le  5]]></fr:tex></fr:link>,
<fr:link href="/ffi/ffi-0020/" title="Height at n ≤ 7" uri="https://www.brendan.phd/ffi/ffi-0020/" display-uri="ffi-0020" type="local">height at <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[n \le  7]]></fr:tex></fr:link>, <fr:link href="/ffi/ffi-0022/" title="Height at n = 8" uri="https://www.brendan.phd/ffi/ffi-0022/" display-uri="ffi-0022" type="local">height at <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[n = 8]]></fr:tex></fr:link> and
<fr:link href="/ffi/ffi-0025/" title="Height at n = 9" uri="https://www.brendan.phd/ffi/ffi-0025/" display-uri="ffi-0025" type="local">height at <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[n = 9]]></fr:tex></fr:link>; their conditionality differs and is
stated on each.</html:p>
    <html:p><html:em>Uses:</html:em> <fr:link href="/ffi/ffi-0009/" title="The height conjecture" uri="https://www.brendan.phd/ffi/ffi-0009/" display-uri="ffi-0009" type="local">The height conjecture</fr:link>, <fr:link href="/ffi/ffi-0019/" title="Height at n ≤ 5" uri="https://www.brendan.phd/ffi/ffi-0019/" display-uri="ffi-0019" type="local">Height at n ≤ 5</fr:link>, <fr:link href="/ffi/ffi-0020/" title="Height at n ≤ 7" uri="https://www.brendan.phd/ffi/ffi-0020/" display-uri="ffi-0020" type="local">Height at n ≤ 7</fr:link>, <fr:link href="/ffi/ffi-0022/" title="Height at n = 8" uri="https://www.brendan.phd/ffi/ffi-0022/" display-uri="ffi-0022" type="local">Height at n = 8</fr:link>,
<fr:link href="/ffi/ffi-0025/" title="Height at n = 9" uri="https://www.brendan.phd/ffi/ffi-0025/" display-uri="ffi-0025" type="local">Height at n = 9</fr:link>.</html:p>
    <html:p>
      <html:em>Provenance: journal thm:height-n7, cor:height-n8, cor:height-n9; commits
afdac1f, e8c7430.</html:em>
    </html:p>
  </fr:mainmatter>
