            <html:p><fr:link href="/ffi/ffi-0009/" title="The height conjecture" uri="https://www.brendan.phd/ffi/ffi-0009/" display-uri="ffi-0009" type="local">The height conjecture</fr:link> holds for <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[n = 8]]></fr:tex> and every prime
power <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[q]]></fr:tex>, conditional only on the published GMR2014 <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[A_7]]></fr:tex> row.</html:p>
            <html:p><html:strong>Mechanism.</html:strong> The address reduction turns <fr:link href="/ffi/ffi-0010/" title="(*): the characteristic-p subvariety inference" uri="https://www.brendan.phd/ffi/ffi-0010/" display-uri="ffi-0010" type="local">(*)</fr:link> at <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[n = 8]]></fr:tex>
