<fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[\operatorname {lc} = 3]]></fr:tex> and are safe, so no violation survives. Exact address
polynomials come from the GR cell engine.</html:p>
            <html:p><html:em>Uses:</html:em> <fr:link href="/ffi/ffi-0009/" title="The height conjecture" uri="https://www.brendan.phd/ffi/ffi-0009/" display-uri="ffi-0009" type="local">The height conjecture</fr:link>, <fr:link href="/ffi/ffi-0023/" title="(S): the n = 9 reduction" uri="https://www.brendan.phd/ffi/ffi-0023/" display-uri="ffi-0023" type="local">(S): the n = 9 reduction</fr:link>, <fr:link href="/ffi/ffi-0024/" title="(S+): the ledger conjecture" uri="https://www.brendan.phd/ffi/ffi-0024/" display-uri="ffi-0024" type="local">(S+): the ledger conjecture</fr:link>.</html:p>
